               "guide_exc_prot_body":  "**Excursion Protection** is a dynamic safety mechanism.\n\n- Monitors measurement + target relationship.\n- Reduces risky bass boost when excursion risk increases.\n- Complements HPF and Boost Lock; it is not a fixed crossover.\n\nRecommended for bass-heavy targets and small woofers.",
               "guide_exc_prot_title":  "🛡️ Guide: Excursion Protection",
               "guide_low_bass_cut_body":  "**Low-bass boost lock** is a hard correction policy.\n\n- Below the selected frequency: **cuts allowed, boosts blocked**.\n- No added latency and no phase change.\n- Useful for bass-reflex systems and uncertain infra-bass measurements.\n\nIn BASIC mode this control is always enabled by policy.",
